 lineage. Preserve the #744/#746 catalog, ASN.1 fixes/vectors, OpenPGP and CTAP2 changes, and removal of superseded metadata/commented code.\n\nResolve renamed PIV key/import and agreement conflicts using direct KeyType identities, our one explicit protocol map, completion-only import, owned Memory results, and session-owned authentication/workflows. Migrate all added enum/helper consumers and representation widths to KeyInfo/CurveInfo without widening PIV support. Keep both new catalog API and response ownership/protected enforcement baselines.\n\nVerify catalog-only secp256k1/Brainpool identities cannot reach generation/import/agreement wire or material export. Hardware-free units: 3810 passed with 5 existing skips; clean build: zero warnings/errors; serial-103 PIV hardware: 83 passed; final reset: 1 passed.\n\nComplexity-Justification: AdminData.TryDecode: Existing strict TLV validation body is unchanged after the earlier requested type rename; retain required field/flag checks without unrelated parser redesign.\nComplexity-Justification: CardholderUniqueId.TryDecode: Existing normalized body is unchanged; explicit CHUID field/length validation is pre-existing protocol complexity.\nComplexity-Justification: CardCapabilityContainer.TryDecode: Earlier type rename only; normalized mandatory CCC validation remains unchanged.\nComplexity-Justification: KeyHistory.TryDecode: Earlier type rename only; normalized count, URL, and TLV validation is unchanged.", "tree": {"sha": "a3f53cebe9fb111a940b16c80f88ecb991310101", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/git/trees/a3f53cebe9fb111a940b16c80f88ecb991310101"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/git/commits/b1362127203beda5e9c797e8648b28e2716c496c", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/commits/b1362127203beda5e9c797e8648b28