talog-only secp256k1/Brainpool identities cannot reach generation/import/agreement wire or material export. Hardware-free units: 3810 passed with 5 existing skips; clean build: zero warnings/errors; serial-103 PIV hardware: 83 passed; final reset: 1 passed.\n\nComplexity-Justification: AdminData.TryDecode: Existing strict TLV validation body is unchanged after the earlier requested type rename; retain required field/flag checks without unrelated parser redesign.\nComplexity-Justification: CardholderUniqueId.TryDecode: Existing normalized body is unchanged; explicit CHUID field/length validation is pre-existing protocol complexity.\nComplexity-Justification: CardCapabilityContainer.TryDecode: Earlier type rename only; normalized mandatory CCC validation remains unchanged.\nComplexity-Justification: KeyHistory.TryDecode: Earlier type rename only; normalized count, URL, and TLV validation is unchanged.", "tree": {"sha": "a3f53cebe9fb111a940b16c80f88ecb991310101", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/git/trees/a3f53cebe9fb111a940b16c80f88ecb991310101"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/git/commits/b1362127203beda5e9c797e8648b28e2716c496c", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/commits/b1362127203beda5e9c797e8648b28e2716c496c", "html_url": "https://github.com/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/commit/b1362127203beda5e9c797e8648b28e2716c496c", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Yubico/Yubico.NET.SDK/commits/b1362127203beda5e9c797e8648b28e2716c496c/comments", "author": {"login": "DennisDyallo", "id": 3703696, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDM2OTY=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3703696?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/DennisDyallo", "html_url": "https://github.com/DennisDyallo", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users